<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Same-Store</p>
<p> Month	   $20.6	$24.8	     +6</p>
<p> Year-to-date $363.1     $369.2	     -4</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended Feb 1</p>
<p>Year-to-date is 52 weeks in the current fiscal year ending Feb 1 vs 53 weeks in the prior year.</p>
<p>Full company name is United Retail Group Inc.</p>
